          },
          {
            "name": "root",
            "docs": ["The root of the Merkle tree."],
            "type": {
              "array": ["u8", 32]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "configurators",
            "docs": [
              "The configurators of the Merkle tree. Users can choose which one to use at claim time."
